Users are represented by [User] and [value]. See [users.get], [users.Get],
[Users.get], and [Users.Get]. Unknown references such as [Missing],
[users.Missing], [io.Reader], and [example.com/pkg.Name] stay literal.

# Examples

  - Read a [User] with [users.get].
    Continue with another sentence.
  - Keep [Missing] as written.

Numbered steps:

  1. Find a [User].
  2. Call [Users.Get].

Preformatted text keeps references and indentation:

    [users.get] id: 1
        [User]

Raw HTML is text: <script>alert("hello")</script>.
See [the guide] or https://example.com/guide.

[the guide]: https://example.com/guide?q=one&other=two
